FROM --platform=linux/amd64 python:3.11-slim-bookworm@sha256:b18992999dbe963a45a8a4da40ac2b1975be1a776d939d098c647482bcad5cba AS bitevlm_lite_v3_amd64

ENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \
    PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \
    HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 \
    HF_HOME=/tmp/huggingface \
    TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 \
    XDG_CACHE_HOME=/tmp/.cache \
    MKL_NUM_THREADS=1 \
    NUMEXPR_NUM_THREADS=1 \
    OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 \
    OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 \
    PYTHONHASHSEED=20260804 \
    VECLIB_MAXIMUM_THREADS=1
LABEL gc_upload_version="2026-08-13-bitevlm-lite-v3"

RUN groupadd -r user && useradd -m --no-log-init -r -g user user
USER user
WORKDIR /opt/app

COPY --chown=user:user submission/bitevlm_lite_v2/requirements.txt /opt/app/
RUN python -m pip install --user --no-cache-dir --no-color --requirement /opt/app/requirements.txt
RUN python -m pip check

COPY --chown=user:user submission/bitevlm_lite_v3/inference.py /opt/app/inference.py
COPY --chown=user:user baselines/vc_fulltrain_model.py baselines/vc_sentence_surgery_runtime.py /opt/app/baselines/
COPY --chown=user:user parsing/schema_parser.py /opt/app/parsing/
COPY --chown=user:user submission/__init__.py /opt/app/submission/__init__.py
COPY --chown=user:user submission/bitevlm_lite_v2/__init__.py submission/bitevlm_lite_v2/inference.py /opt/app/submission/bitevlm_lite_v2/
COPY --chown=user:user submission/mesh_retrieval_v1/__init__.py submission/mesh_retrieval_v1/mesh_retrieval_runtime.py /opt/app/submission/mesh_retrieval_v1/
COPY --chown=user:user vlm_lite/__init__.py vlm_lite/g0_probability_runtime_v2.py vlm_lite/photo_encoder_runtime_v1.py vlm_lite/production_runtime_v1.py vlm_lite/fact_rerank_runtime_v1.py vlm_lite/per_case_fail_open_runtime_v1.py /opt/app/vlm_lite/

ENTRYPOINT ["python", "inference.py"]
